  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the end of three years from the date of this permission.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with the provisions of Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans: Site location plan; Existing and proposed elevation drawings (ref. T2095 - pages 1 to 4 inclusive); Detailed joinery specifications pack (ref. T2095 version 1.0 dated 01/12/2025 - pages 1 to 34 inclusive); Detailed section drawings pack (ref. T2095 version 1.0 dated 03/12/2025 - pages 1 to 34 inclusive); Design, access and heritage statement from Sashed Ltd. (version 1.0) dated 01/12/2025; Sustainable design and construction statement from Sashed Ltd. received 17/12/2025.\r\n\r\nReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interest of proper planning.\r\n",
    "Condition : 3 - All new external work shall be carried out in materials that resemble, as closely as possible, in colour and texture those of the existing building, unless otherwise specified in the approved application. \r\n\r\nReason: To safeguard the appearance of the premises and the character of the immediate area in accordance with the requirements of policies D1 and D2 of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017, and policies DH1 and DH2 of the Hampstead Neighbourhood Plan 2018."
